{
  "id": "p45",
  "title": "The Castle Wedding",
  "titleZh": "城堡婚礼",
  "topic": "城堡婚礼与身份丑闻",
  "paragraphs": [
    [
      {
        "en": "The old castle hosts a wedding for the whole town.",
        "zh": "那座古老的城堡为全镇人举办一场婚礼。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Our small budget cannot confirm a second warm banquet for the guests.",
        "zh": "我们那点预算无法再为客人确认第二场温暖的宴席。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The style is simple, yet the quality looks quietly rich and warm.",
        "zh": "风格朴素，可质感看起来低调地丰厚而温暖。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A live band will attract a much younger generation from nearby.",
        "zh": "一支现场乐队会从附近吸引来年轻得多的一代。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The printed card quotes a novel as its clear reference for the evening.",
        "zh": "印好的请柬引用一部小说，作为当晚明确的参照。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The union of two families becomes a public celebration.",
        "zh": "两个家庭的结合成了一场公开的庆典。"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "en": "A wooden barrier blocks the narrow road to the gate.",
        "zh": "一道木栅栏挡住了通向大门的那条窄路。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The actual bride is late, and her long absence worries us badly.",
        "zh": "真正的新娘迟迟不到，她长久的缺席让我们十分担心。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Then a guard checks identity and may expose any hidden crime.",
        "zh": "接着一名守卫查验身份，可能会揭出任何隐藏的罪过。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A cruel trick hides a coming scandal, we all fear.",
        "zh": "我们都害怕，一个残酷的恶作剧掩盖着一桩即将爆出的丑闻。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A camera flash lights a bat above the tall tower.",
        "zh": "一道相机闪光灯照亮了高塔上方的一只蝙蝠。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A dark tunnel leads where old stone stairs plunge down.",
        "zh": "一条黑暗的隧道通向老石阶陡然下坠的地方。"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "en": "My delighted mother holds the small gift to her breast.",
        "zh": "我母亲满心欢喜，把那件小礼物抱在胸前。"
      },
      {
        "en": "An aggressive teenager pushes past a quiet older guest at the door.",
        "zh": "一个横冲直撞的少年在门口挤过一位安静的年长客人。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Later one individual raises an issue about the crowded seating.",
        "zh": "后来有一个人提出了座位过于拥挤的问题。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A short domestic survey asks about food, music, and the seating.",
        "zh": "一份简短的家庭问卷询问食物、音乐和座位情况。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A thick layer of dust covers the crystal glasses.",
        "zh": "厚厚一层灰盖住了水晶杯。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A small seed of doubt becomes an exciting spark, to some extent.",
        "zh": "一小粒怀疑的种子在某种程度上变成了一簇令人兴奋的火花。"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "en": "The republic calls this event a test of democracy in a small state.",
        "zh": "共和国把这场活动称作一次在小国里的民主考验。"
      },
      {
        "en": "My concentration fails, and I slip on the wet step.",
        "zh": "我的注意力散了，在湿台阶上滑了一下。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The index lists every guest, with one clear and surprising exception.",
        "zh": "名册列出了每位客人，只有一个明确而令人意外的例外。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Then a reporter cites the letter but ignores its context.",
        "zh": "接着一名记者引用了那封信，却忽略了它的语境。"
      },
      {
        "en": "His nightmare began in exile, far from this cold northern place.",
        "zh": "他的噩梦始于流亡之中，离这个寒冷的北方之地很远。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Earlier we planned this for his fortieth birthday.",
        "zh": "早些时候我们是为他的四十岁生日筹划这件事的。"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "en": "My father realizes this match was never about fate alone.",
        "zh": "我父亲意识到这桩婚事从来不只是关乎命运。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Protection fails when an attack comes from inside the old stone hall.",
        "zh": "当攻击来自老石厅内部时，保护就失效了。"
      },
      {
        "en": "He cannot fulfil his promise, and she looks disappointed.",
        "zh": "他无法兑现承诺，她看上去很失望。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Unfortunately a roach crawls past, and one guest gives a glance.",
        "zh": "不幸的是，一只蟑螂爬过，一位客人瞥了一眼。"
      }
    ]
  ],
